REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1109},{"title":"Create service configuration rules for a service configuration","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/create-appt-booking-service-config-rules.md","line":1150},{"title":"Configuring Appointment Booking","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/appointment-booking-administer.md","line":1253},{"title":"Scripted REST Service form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_CustomWebServices.md","line":1261},{"title":"REST API Explorer","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/use-REST-API-Explorer.md","line":1261},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1443},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1456},{"title":"Scripted REST Service form","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_CustomWebServices.md","line":1585},{"title":"REST API Explorer","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/use-REST-API-Explorer.md","line":1585},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1800},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1813},{"title":"Scripted REST APIs","target":"c_CustomWebServices","line":2166},{"title":"REST APIs","target":"c_RESTAPI","line":2167}],"metadata":{"title":"Appointment API","description":"The Appointment API provides endpoints for interacting with the appointment booking application. Use this API to book and reschedule appointments, check available appointment slots, and fetch appointment booking configuration details.Returns the time range for which you can book appointments. The return results honor the lead time and maximum future bookable dates configured in the appointment booking service configuration.Returns the configuration defined in a specified Appointment Booking Service Configuration.Returns the sys\\_id of the appointment booking service configuration rule that matches a specified task sys\\_id or a set of specified catalog item data.Enables you to book and reschedule appointments for a Field Service Management task.Returns the slots that have been configured in the appointment booking service configuration along with their availability.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/rest-apis/appointment-api.html","release":"australia","product":"REST APIs","classification":"rest-apis","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":30,"breadcrumb":["REST API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#rest","#table-api","#json","#http","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[150,155],[186,191],[195,202],[302,318],[385,403],[508,515],[533,539],[581,587],[692,699],[764,769],[800,806],[850,855],[859,1002],[1071,1079],[1135,1142],[1188,1197],[1201,1210],[1216,1232],[1236,1245],[1481,1488],[1535,1556],[1560,1569],[1721,1729],[1839,1849],[1859,1869],[1965,1975],[2093,2112],[2116,2162]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/rest-apis/appointment-api.md"},
